<div class="post">
	 <h3 class="storytitle" id="post-87"><a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?p=87" rel="bookmark">New Stuff!</a></h3>
	<div class="meta">Filed under: <a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?cat=7" title="View all posts in Art" rel="category">Art</a>,<a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?cat=4" title="View all posts in Conventions" rel="category">Conventions</a>,<a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?cat=2" title="View all posts in Jewelry" rel="category">Jewelry</a> &#8212; Nuri at 2:00 pm on Wednesday, April 22, 2009  </div>
	
	<div class="storycontent">
		<p>My new supply order finally came in the mail! Check out these cute new earrings I made:</p>
<p><a href="http://www.etsy.com/view_listing.php?listing_id=24016747"><img src="http://www.candycornstudios.com/pics/panda_th.jpg"></a></p>
<p>I love these lampwork pandas! They are SO CUTE! I wanted to hang them from a lucky bamboo plant, but I didn&#8217;t happen to have one around. </p>
<p>And of course, I finally got some hanging mannequins to display the shirts. This will help quite a bit at Animazement! The girl is a little nipply, though&#8230;Makes me wonder if I should buy her a bra for the shows.</p>
<p><a href="http://www.etsy.com/view_listing.php?listing_id=24017151"><img src="http://www.candycornstudios.com/pics/gears_th.jpg"></a></p>
<p>(Pssst&#8230;these thumbnails both link to the items in the store. There&#8217;s only one of each, so it&#8217;s first-come first-served.)</p>
	</div>
	
