<div class="post">
	 <h3 class="storytitle" id="post-85"><a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?p=85" rel="bookmark">Holy Frak, a Podcast!</a></h3>
	<div class="meta">Filed under: <a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?cat=7" title="View all posts in Art" rel="category">Art</a>,<a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?cat=8" title="View all posts in Podcast" rel="category">Podcast</a>,<a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?cat=36" title="View all posts in Updates" rel="category">Updates</a> &#8212; Nuri at 1:16 pm on Friday, April 17, 2009  </div>
	
	<div class="storycontent">
		<p>We finally released the 3rd episode of our 3-part series, Clay to Wax. Sorry for those who were waiting that it took so long! There are a few more episodes in the works, so more content should be flowing reasonably soon. Keep pestering us about new episodes! It really does help.</p>
<p><a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/ArtistAlley/?p=53">Artist Alley # 36 &#8211; Clay to Wax Pt. 3</a></p>
