<div class="post">
	 <h3 class="storytitle" id="post-82"><a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?p=82" rel="bookmark">Jewelry, Hats, Shirts Pages Updated</a></h3>
	<div class="meta">Filed under: <a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?cat=4" title="View all posts in Conventions" rel="category">Conventions</a>,<a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?cat=2" title="View all posts in Jewelry" rel="category">Jewelry</a>,<a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?cat=36" title="View all posts in Updates" rel="category">Updates</a> &#8212; Nuri at 12:26 pm on Wednesday, April 15, 2009  </div>
	
	<div class="storycontent">
		<p>Thumbnail galleries have been added to the product pages so all of the visitors coming over from the convention pages have something to look at! In particular, check out the jewelry page; there are even a few links to specific new items in the store!</p>
<p><a href="http://www.etsy.com/view_listing.php?listing_id=23681588"><img src="http://www.candycornstudios.com/pics/gal/earrings1.jpg"></a><a href="http://www.etsy.com/view_listing.php?listing_id=23681705"><img src="http://www.candycornstudios.com/pics/gal/mini1.jpg"></a><a href="http://www.etsy.com/view_listing.php?listing_id=23665086"><img src="http://www.candycornstudios.com/pics/gal/stud1.jpg"></a></p>
<p>I&#8217;ve started restocking the Etsy store (link at the top of the page&#8230;check it out) with new jewelry. Remember, each item (except the stud earrings) is one-of-a-kind, so if you see something you like, don&#8217;t wait until you see me at a con to get it! It might be gone by then.</p>
<p>Custom requests (currently the only way to get shirts and hats, as they are not regularly stocked in the Etsy store at the moment) are welcome now. Use the contact form on this site or convo me through Etsy; either way, it goes to my email!</p>
	</div>
	
	<div class="feedback">
                        <a href="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?p=82#respond" title="Comment on Jewelry, Hats, Shirts Pages Updated">Comments (0)</a>	</div>
	
	<!--
	<rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
			xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"
			xmlns:trackback="http://madskills.com/public/xml/rss/module/trackback/">
		<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?p=82"
    dc:identifier="http://www.candycornstudios.com/?p=82"
    dc:title="Jewelry, Hats, Shirts Pages Updated"
